    text: "Untouched-base comparison completed in a separate temporary clone at f3163466b with the same installed dependencies and Node 26.9.0. Base SDK import gate failed aggregate 514/500 ms and merge 252/226 ms; base CLI failed get 388/362, next 448/440, create 403/398 ms. Candidate isolated Node 26 rerun failed merge 232/226 and five CLI operations. Candidate Node 24.12.0 passed all 10 SDK imports; CLI failures moved to list 432/419, context 442/433, claim 425/415 ms. This confirms admission failures also exist on the unchanged base, not a clean local performance qualification. It does not identify the cause or exclude smaller regressions. Preserve all budgets; use hosted exact-head checks and continue this canonical diagnosis separately."
