    text: "The same retained CI39795098726 also times out the unchanged agent-evidence-consistency-control.spec.ts negative_control=true case at240000ms, then correctly reports an empty verdict log rather than the expected injected negative verdict. The test and driver are byte-identical to baseline main in this delivery. Full nightly on the identical source passes the complete corpus. Record this second failure explicitly; do not call it a fixed test or attribute it to host load without evidence. Final metadata delivery will receive fresh required CI without changing this deadline or assertion."
  - created_at: "2026-10-23T07:01:59.271Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "October23 local full coverage completed854 files /11060 tests in1379.94s:11052 passed,5 failed,3 platform skips. Four failed cases were timing: two scale-benchmark cases at30s, extension-startup own-command activation at37.2s, and packed continuation at121.8s. The fifth was an expected renderer parity assertion after the compact SDK accounting correction and is fixed in the active read-envelope tranche. The packed harness now compiles all three declaration fixtures in one tsc invocation, preserving every fixture and deadline. Retain this attempt; retry affected cases sequentially and require hosted shard/global coverage proof before merge. No deadline or coverage threshold was increased."
  - created_at: "2026-10-23T07:25:24.787Z"
