    text: "October23 follow-up admission: one qualified SDK import sample failed sdk/merge median258ms against226ms; the bounded repeat of the unchanged gate then passed all10 entrypoints. The subsequent qualified CLI floor sample failed get best365ms against362ms (3ms). Preserve both product-admission failures as failures; no threshold, budget, runner qualification or code was changed to admit them. An alternating comparison with the immutable published2026.10.23 SDK merge entrypoint is being collected, and exact-head hosted import/transport gates remain mandatory before merge."
  - created_at: "2026-10-23T07:29:15.113Z"
