    text: "Alternating7-run import diagnostic against the immutable published2026.10.23 artifact: sdk/merge base min204ms/median311ms/p95676ms; checkout min210ms/median260ms/p95368ms. Both diagnostic medians exceed the existing226ms ceiling, so this is retained as comparative evidence rather than an admission pass. The unchanged full10-entrypoint import gate separately passed; CLI transport admission still retains the3ms get overrun. Exact-head hosted gates are required and no local result is relabeled."
