    text: "PR1574 CodSpeed comparison at eb940fedd reports encodeQueryCursor208.7us to212.1us(-1.6percent), while createQueryFingerprint improves2.93percent. The report explicitly compares different runner types and flags significant unmeasured system calls; its check is neutral, not a demonstrated equivalent-runner regression. The pagination benchmark and implementation are unchanged in this PR. Required hosted transport/static checks pass. Preserve the report and qualification limits under this existing performance owner; no baselines, ceilings or code are altered to acknowledge the result."
  - created_at: "2026-10-24T19:19:34.371Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "October24 calendar-warning closeout preserves three unsuccessful local performance admissions on unchanged Node26.12.1 budgets. The complete static chain reached SDK import admission and refused sdk/core median486ms against423ms, with bare controls46/58ms within106ms. One unchanged isolated SDK recheck refused sdk/graph197/172ms while core356ms passed; its controls48/51ms remain qualified. The separately completed CLI-floor census also refused get438/362ms, context437/433ms, next464/440ms, create423/398ms and claim443/415ms with qualified64/60ms controls. These are product-budget failures, not runner-unqualified evidence. Retain original reports static-calendar-warning-final.log, import-cost-warning-recheck.log and warning-tail-transport.log locally; no budgets, qualification policy, tests or deadlines changed. The immediately preceding complete runtime revision passed full static and exact11208-test coverage, but that does not erase these later failures. Source/package/contract gates preceding import admission passed, and separately completed graph composition, record integrity and governed mutation (345killed/7equivalent of352;98.01percent) pass. Historical causation remains unproven. Require the final exact-head hosted full static/coverage checks; this existing broad diagnosis remains open and unclaimed. No duplicate issue is created.\n"
  - created_at: "2026-10-24T21:14:44.342Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "October24 merge continuation retains qualified local startup admissions without changing any budget: full static reached sdk/graph273/172ms with61ms control; an unchanged isolated recheck passed graph137ms but failed aggregate506/500ms, core443/423ms and merge370/226ms with59ms control. A separate CLI floor census failed get407/362, context439/433, next503/440, create439/398 and claim463/415ms with53ms control. Source cause remains unproven; these are product-budget failures under the current qualifier, not runner-unqualified evidence. The previously recorded changing qualified failures remain relevant. Require final exact-head hosted static/coverage admission. Keep this broad owner open/unclaimed; no ceiling or runtime floor is relaxed."
