    text: "Settled local full-run diagnosis corrects the earlier timing inference:11366 tests passed and4 failed. The continuation test failed because this Node26 runtime cannot resolve npm/package.json, not a test deadline. Three failures belong to the active receipt change (portable history, exact history context, deterministic key order) and will be fixed under pm-gh1579. Full coverage did not emit its summary because test execution failed; no exact-coverage pass is claimed. The early linked test also failed from its240-second build-lease wait and will be rerun after builds settle."
