    text: "The unchanged composed-continuation test passes in isolation (Node and Bun packed SDK journeys) after exposing the installed npm package via NODE_PATH for this Homebrew Node26 runtime. No test deadline, assertion or production source was changed for that environment repair. The three receipt-related failures also pass in the revised87-test focused cohort; the original complete-run and linked timeout evidence remain retained."
