    text: "October25 current SDK delivery: authoritative static pipeline reached the transport floor and reported qualified runner control43ms but get best400ms against362ms. The unchanged829af6fe1 checkout also failed admission: get460ms and create400ms, with qualified control96ms. One controlled candidate run with the same normal environment as that baseline passed all six operations. Retained all receipts; no latency/RSS budget, qualification rule or deadline changed. These measurements do not establish patch causality or erase the earlier failure; final hosted static validation remains mandatory."
  - created_at: "2026-10-26T00:22:46.697Z"
