    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Continuation evidence on Node 26.12.1: the unchanged SDK import-cost gate first failed merge at 227 ms versus 226 ms, then a separate retry failed query at 247 ms versus 241 ms. Both controls qualified at 50-53 ms versus 106 ms. A disposable archive of immutable main ce979159acfe034217a5694a3e826940895b3581, excluding tracker data and using isolated PM roots, also failed governance at 343 versus 327 ms and merge at 241 versus 226 ms with a qualified 55 ms control. The transport gate on the candidate failed get/context/next/create/claim admission. Some diagnostic measurements overlapped other validation processes; these observations do not establish a source regression or its cause. Preserve failed admissions and current thresholds. The selected recovery changes keep those limits intact; exact-head hosted results remain independently required."
