    text: "Current Node24.21 full static run passes all preceding semantic/static/contract/tracker gates but transport product admission fails create409/398ms. A separate unchanged candidate run fails only create400/398 with a qualified37ms control. An independently built disposable archive of immutable b76d697ee also fails get419/362 and create440/398 with a qualified45ms control, using the unchanged ten-sample isolated one-item protocol and the same installed runtime dependencies. These measurements do not establish patch causality and do not waive product admission. Keep every ceiling and runner criterion unchanged; require exact-head hosted static acceptance. Remaining graph/record/mutation checks and complete functional coverage are being run separately so this local static attempt is not described as all green."
