    text: "Admission distinction: the unchanged strict hosted static job passes on1c534fce727cf29d22cc44c20db570d41a357712 (job122381186596), and every required check on that head is successful with verified publishers. This clears candidate delivery admission without waiving any threshold. Local isolated candidate create400ms vs398ms and original get419vs362/create440vs398 remain retained observations on this host; they do not establish patch causality. No timing threshold, retry count or benchmark baseline was altered."
