    text: "PR1616 qualification observation: unchanged merge-receipt-settlement.integration.spec.ts exceeds its original30second test deadline on released baseline b5241ced0 in CI40631210889/job122629413161 and on SDK candidate a20864701 in CI40633615811/job122635932547. Both primary logs name the same durable-proof/stale-local-copy case. One unchanged-head failed-job rerun passes all26 required contexts. The candidate file is byte-identical to released main, and the earlier SDK head also passes Windows. Native where.exe startup exceeded its1second probe budget on the failing candidate runner. These are timing/pressure symptoms with unconfirmed root cause, not evidence of a new SDK data regression. Reuse this startup-qualification owner for supported-Windows stage/pressure controls and independent base comparison; preserve every existing assertion, retry, deadline and admission ratchet until an evidence-backed correction is reviewed. No duplicate item, threshold change or new implementation claim."
