    text: "Current array-isolation revision passes all11519 source tests and exact100/100/100/100 coverage. Full static reaches qualified CLI transport admission and fails only create at401ms versus the unchanged398ms ceiling; control median46ms is within106ms, so preserve this as a qualified product-budget failure. Source report records load averages12.1/11.23/10.81 before and10/10.82/10.68 after on8available CPUs. Compare immutable a20864701 in an isolated build with identical dependencies and original benchmark settings before assigning cause. Do not lower thresholds or relabel this failed sample as a pass."
