    text: "Final local requalification completes pnpm quality:static with exit0 on the same array-isolation production source, including the unchanged transport floor and subsequent graph/record/mutation gates. Earlier qualified failures and the Btrfs controls remain failed historical observations; do not rewrite them as runner refusals or claim an established cause. The SDK source revision has full11519-test exact100coverage and fresh packed/linked proof; final hosted admission remains a delivery gate."
  - created_at: "2026-10-28T14:38:46.780Z"
