    text: "PR #1616 recurrence-validation static qualification passed the dependency, import-cost, schema, grammar, refusal, token, tracker and gate-registry stages but the qualified Node24 transport sample failed unchanged product limits: get369>362ms, next455>440ms, create430>398ms and claim419>415ms; control median68ms<=106ms, host load5.7/10.54/10.63 on8 CPUs. Preserve this as a failed local admission, alongside the earlier variable samples and exact-head hosted checks. npm/Bun packed probes finished before the transport sample. No timeout, retry, qualification threshold or product budget changed; a focused recheck and remaining independent gates follow."
