  - created_at: "2026-10-28T23:19:03.931Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "PR #1621 validation recurrence: head 4d2a20af11734e3eddc41a6cf5b7fc25375af195 initially failed Windows script cohort 2/2 in CI run 40783675212, job 123152027862. The unchanged scale-benchmark custom-manifest keeper exceeded its 30000ms timeout and fixed product targets (SDK create p95 2367ms and claim 3051ms, each ceiling 1000ms). The benchmark, test and workflow have no diff from preceding head 512184eb9, where all required checks passed. After the complete run finished, one failed-jobs retry on the same head passed all required checks with no source, timeout, qualification or budget changes. Preserve the first failed admission; retry success does not establish its cause. Current local transport also failed on candidate and untouched base f8ca152d, while both tested PR heads passed hosted static/performance admission. This existing diagnosis remains open and unclaimed; no duplicate issue or performance fix is claimed. Evidence: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/actions/runs/40783675212"
  - created_at: "2026-10-29T08:53:05.656Z"
