    text: "Final bounded transport recheck remains a qualified local failure: best get364ms versus362ms, context443ms versus433ms, and next484ms versus440ms. Stop local timing retries and retain this operational limitation separately from hosted acceptance. The earlier detached untouched-main control also failed create405ms versus398ms. No budget, assertion, retry policy or deadline changed."
